  "story": [
    "At 05:00 the brain audits every note and link it holds.",
    "At 07:00 Secretary reads my four inboxes and commits what matters to the brain, with a register row and a Maybe: hold on my calendar.",
    "At 10:00 a study pack is waiting, and at 16:00 new Canvas assignments turn into course notes and work blocks.",
    "Whichever agent I open, Claude Code, Codex or Antigravity, boots from the same vault and leaves its changes in the day's note.",
